<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices firm.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices firm.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate (DAP) and ammonia were steady to firm Friday, as demand has increased for the Midwest spring planting season, dealers said.</p>
<p>Some dealers quotedcentral Florida were lower at mid-week, but others disputed those quotes and said prices had been firm throughout the week.</p>
<p>			   Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	  174-175			nc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf    187-189		 UP 2.00</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		195		     UNC</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
